[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0168","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1701","title":"Microsoft Windows Win32k.sys 本地提权漏洞","description":"Windows 内核模式驱动程序 Win32k.sys 存在权限提升漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意应用程序触发内核内存破坏，将本地普通用户权限提升至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2 和 Server 2008 SP2 等旧版本系统，属于本地权限提升漏洞（CVSS 7.8 HIGH），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度低、需低权限、无需用户交互，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。该漏洞在 2015 年 4 月已被在野利用（编号 MS15-051），Microsoft 已发布安全更新 MS15-051 修复，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1701"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-21T10:59:00.073","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:50.733","remediation":"立即安装微软发布的 MS15-051 安全更新（KB3020393，2015-05-12 发布），受影响系统包括 Windows Server 2003 SP2、Vista SP2、Server 2008 SP2。因这些系统已停止主流支持，强烈建议升级至仍在支持周期内的 Windows 版本（如 Windows 10/11 或 Server 2016+）。若无法立即打补丁，可采取临时缓解措施：限制本地账户登录权限、禁用不必要的系统服务、配置防火墙限制本地端口访问，降低本地提权攻击面。CISA 已将该漏洞列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/May/34","http://twitter.com/symantec/statuses/590208710527549440","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74245","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032155","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-051","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37049/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37367/","https://www.fireeye.com/blog/threat-research/2015/04/probable_apt28_useo.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1701","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37049","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1701.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2015-1701.yar","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-1701.json","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2015-1701/README.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/eae7ac0ecf3ee3e622251b26a01cbfaff8bc97ef/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-2015-1701.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-2015-1701/Exploit_Win32_CVE-2015-1701_A.yar","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation/blob/e8fa2760f0ea29d1cdc759c623021d5ab7b715e2/CVE-2015-1701/MS15-051%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E.txt","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-1701-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/rsmudge/ElevateKit/blob/f7fbfa35cad39ca0f5658d689262336adca812f1/README.txt","https://github.com/sophoslabs/IoCs/blob/37d0fed4bd91123f5835a660b8376acc8b8aee8a/Ransomware-Netwalker","https://github.com/hfiref0x/CVE-2015-1701","https://github.com/Anonymous-Family/CVE-2015-1701","https://github.com/Anonymous-Family/CVE-2015-1701-download","https://github.com/gousseine-systems/vuln-rabilit-windows7"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0409","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-3043","title":"Adobe 产品 Flash Player 内存损坏漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在内存损坏漏洞（CWE-787 越界写入），攻击者可通过未指定的攻击向量触发内存损坏，导致远程任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 OS X 上 13.0.0.281 之前版本、14.x 至 17.x 中 17.0.0.169 之前版本，以及 Linux 上 11.2.202.457 之前版本。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互。2015 年 4 月已发现在野利用，攻击者可诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件触发漏洞，获取系统控制权或导致浏览器崩溃拒绝服务。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-3043"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-14T22:59:21.323","updated":"2026-06-17T00:25:10.877","remediation":"立即卸载 Adobe Flash Player（已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日停止支持），Windows 用户可通过“控制面板 → 程序和功能 → 卸载 Adobe Flash Player”或运行 Adobe 官方卸载工具（https://fpdownload.macromedia.com/get/flashplayer/current/uninstall_flash_player.exe）彻底移除；Linux 用户执行 `sudo apt remove flashplugin-installer` 或 `sudo yum remove flash-plugin` 卸载；浏览器端彻底禁用 Flash 插件（Chrome/Edge/Firefox 均已默认禁用）。如因遗留业务必须暂时保留，请升级至最后版本：Windows/macOS 升级至 32.0.0.465（最终版），Linux 升级至 11.2.202.635，并配置浏览器点击播放策略、禁用自动播放、部署网络层拦截 Flash 内容作为临时缓解，但必须制定淘汰计划彻底移除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-04/msg00010.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-04/msg00011.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-04/msg00012.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-04/msg00013.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2015-0813.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74062","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032105","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-06.html","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201504-07","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37536/","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-3043","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-3043.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/264ef61746a7918b62cf1abbd77516d3c9b09ba8/2015/CVE-2015-3043.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-3043","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-3043/poc.py","https://github.com/developer3000S/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/5362feecf9e48e17ecc9407c5f6eea87373ae3ee/2015/CVE-2015-3043.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2015/gb_suse_2015_0723_1.nasl","https://github.com/5bhuv4n35h/buffer_overflow/blob/b9a6b6aa4779eda622a80a710be3757f4e9660fb/buffer_exploits/txt/37879.txt","https://github.com/thdusdl1219/CVE-Study/blob/6bc0a2f8bf5ddd6089bc9ce22188a24c1d44d24e/CVEs/CVE-2015-3041/README.md","https://github.com/UMBC-Onramp/CyEnts-Cyber-Blog-Dataset/blob/d8b7716ce5f02208e93484a41a6d0f0da4a811e0/Paragraphs/probable_apt28_useo@html!!PART4.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2015-0350","https://github.com/whitehairman/Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0108","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1641","title":"Microsoft Office Word 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 多个版本存在内存破坏漏洞（CNVD-2015-02509），攻击者可通过构造特制的 RTF（Rich Text Format）文档，诱使用户打开该恶意文件来触发漏洞。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Word 2007 SP3、Office 2010 SP2、Word 2010 SP2、Word 2013 SP1、Word 2013 RT SP1、Word for Mac 2011、Office Compatibility Pack SP3，以及 SharePoint Server 2010/2013 和 Office Web Apps Server 2010/2013 中的 Word Automation Services。成功利用此漏洞可导致远程代码执行，攻击者能以当前用户权限执行任意恶意代码，进而完全控制系统。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.8（高危），已被 CISA 纳入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），在野攻击中被 APT 组织（如 Sednit）利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1641"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-14T20:59:05.250","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:45.033","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS15-033 对应的补丁程序（可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载）。受影响产品包括 Word 2007 SP3、Office 2010 SP2、Word 2010 SP2、Word 2013 SP1、Word 2013 RT SP1、Word for Mac 2011、Office Compatibility Pack SP3 等，需分别安装各自对应的更新补丁。若无法立即打补丁，应避免打开来源不明的 RTF 格式文档，并在 Office 中启用受保护视图（Protected View）以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/73995","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032104","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-033","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1641","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1641.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-1641.json","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2015-1641.lua","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2015-1641/README.md","https://github.com/eset/malware-ioc/blob/812c573dc8c354210893775b2de97d1fbf29be1b/sednit/part1.adoc","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-1641.rules","https://github.com/SuperKieran/WooyunDrops/blob/df3319b3cd839f447ba2d1ab191b6a4b57991d0a/static/drops/837.CVE-2015-1641%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.html","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/838bea570a3c6bbfbfd8b68e39b1ead2544da1f7/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1641.json","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/115%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/RedDrip7/APT_Digital_Weapon/blob/cc4cde356dcb4455419d80aedc3bba471249f167/White%20Company/White%20Company_hash.md","https://github.com/Cyberclues/rtf_exploit_extractor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0022","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1635","title":"Microsoft Windows HTTP.sys 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft HTTP.sys协议栈在处理特制的HTTP请求头（特别是Range头）时存在整数溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向运行IIS服务的Windows系统发送精心构造的HTTP请求，触发HTTP.sys中的内存损坏，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows 8、Windows 8.1以及Windows Server 2012等多个版本，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级为严重。攻击者无需任何身份凭据即可利用此漏洞完全控制目标服务器，Microsoft已于2015年4月发布安全公告MS15-034修复此漏洞，强烈建议受影响用户立即安装补丁。该漏洞已被CISA纳入已知被利用漏洞目录，实际攻击中已被广泛利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1635"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-14T20:59:01.263","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:44.360","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS15-034 对应的补丁程序 KB3042553，可通过 Windows Update 或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动下载安装。若无法立即打补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中禁用内核缓存（netsh http show cachestate），或通过防火墙限制对 IIS 服务的外部访问，仅允许内网访问。受影响系统包括 Windows 7 SP1、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows 8/8.1、Windows Server 2012/R2，升级后需重启服务器以确保 HTTP.sys 驱动加载修复后的版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131463/Microsoft-Windows-HTTP.sys-Proof-Of-Concept.html","http://www.osvdb.org/120629","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74013","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032109","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-034","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36773/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36776/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1635","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36776","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1635.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1635.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-1635.json","https://github.com/lofiCafe/PoC-Bank/blob/d02ccfb88d72f0bc7bc260f78844799f4dcb0418/CVE-2015-1635/CVE-2015-1635.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/dcd2e1032c4bae31e4bd3250341719f0e9cb0ea6/data/2015/CVE-2015-1635-xPaw_HTTPsys.md","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2015-1635.yaml","https://github.com/KINGSABRI/CVE-in-Ruby/blob/761ff3bc2da6999fc193fece83257a03ef25c7af/CVE-2015-1635/cve-2015-1635_exploit.rb","https://github.com/Cloudflare-Mining/Cloudflare-Datamining/blob/a2a4a6cb629f19e914502709ab6cd12ae96058a8/data/blog/cloudflare-is-protected-against-cve-2015-1635.html","https://github.com/Coldwave96/PocLibrary/blob/4bdc069c257f441379e9fd428ac8df7d4f5e9ca9/Library/IIS/CVE-2015-1635-POC_vul.txt","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/545bcd8597cc3b9d8b481864a2e702aeb0637082/doc/2025-06/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%9ACVE-2015-1635%E3%80%81CVE-2017-0144.md","https://github.com/PlutoaCharon/AWD-Attack-Defense/blob/20082eb00d30e516502bed737dd9dd50217d0c05/POC-Collect-master/POC-Collect-master/CVE_EXP/CVE-2015-1635/README.md","https://github.com/technion/erlvulnscan","https://github.com/aedoo/CVE-2015-1635-POC","https://github.com/Zx7ffa4512-Python/Project-CVE-2015-1635","https://github.com/h3x0v3rl0rd/CVE-2015-1635-POC","https://github.com/neu5ron/cve_2015-1635"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0022.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0022.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0100","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1130","title":"Apple OS X 权限提升漏洞","description":"Apple OS X Admin Framework 的 XPC 实现存在权限提升漏洞（称为 Rootpipe），本地低权限攻击者可通过未指定的 XPC 向量绕过身份验证，直接获取管理员/Root 权限。该漏洞影响 OS X 10.10.3 之前的版本（含 10.7.5、10.8.2、10.9.5、10.10.2），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地、低复杂度、低权限、无需用户交互。攻击者仅需本地普通用户权限，即可利用 XPC 机制绕过认证实现提权。Apple 已在 OS X 10.10.3 中修复，该漏洞已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1130"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-10T14:59:43.073","updated":"2026-06-17T00:21:50.007","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Apple OS X 10.10.3 或更高版本以获取完整修复。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用 Admin Framework 服务并限制本地用户权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2015/Apr/msg00001.html","http://www.osvdb.org/120418","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/73982","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032048","https://support.apple.com/HT204659","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36692/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1130","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36692","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1130.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-1130.json","https://github.com/CCrashBandicot/helpful/blob/336b2c95b482d6c9de7756109b2699c7cfd8545c/CVE-2015-1130.py","https://github.com/fozavci/metasploit-framework-with-viproy/blob/3f7d0cdc0bb1423f9e952e411d073a1424ef9f5e/data/exploits/CVE-2015-1130/exploit.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-1130","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/838bea570a3c6bbfbfd8b68e39b1ead2544da1f7/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1130.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-1130-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/vulncheck-oss/0day.today.archive/blob/3664abdd71985a44aff3260896a8f36e2f4a9682/local-exploits/23491.txt","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/6cba76768b56c5810019c15784c53ea69c237b25/2015/README.md","https://github.com/FuzzySecurity/Unix-PrivEsc/blob/d627304c1ced8c0da12a229393f7436216f19a5a/rootpipe.py","https://github.com/sideeffect42/RootPipeTester","https://github.com/Shmoopi/RootPipe-Demo"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0017","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2166","title":"Ericsson Drutt Mobile Service Delivery Platform 4/5/6 Instance Monitor 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Ericsson Drutt MSDP（移动业务交付平台）4、5、6 版本的 Instance Monitor 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向默认 URI 中注入 `..%2f`（点号编码斜杠）绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低，已有公开 PoC 可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2166"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-04-06T15:59:02.213","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:41.940","remediation":"联系 Ericsson 获取 MSDP 4/5/6 的安全补丁（2015 年 3 月 12 日已发布），升级 Instance Monitor 组件至修复版本。如无法升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截包含 `..%2f` 或 `%2e%2e%2f` 等路径遍历编码的 URI 请求，并限制 Instance Monitor 对外网的访问，仅允许管理网段访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131233/Ericsson-Drutt-MSDP-Instance-Monitor-Directory-Traversal-File-Access.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/73901","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36619/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36619","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2166.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2166.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-2166.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2166.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2166/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-2166.py","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2166_8.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2166-2493.yaml","https://github.com/gongzeq/VAPT3/blob/3576a7accf5cbadc8e64924d6ff48393db379ea7/secbot/resource/poc/cve/cve-2015-2166-2493.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2015/CVE-2015-2166/README.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2015-2166-2494.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/18/lfiArtifact/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2015-2166-EXPLOIT"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0099","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0666","title":"Cisco Prime Data Center Network Manager 目录遍历文件读取漏洞","description":"Cisco Prime Data Center Network Manager (DCNM) 7.1(1) 之前版本的 fmserver servlet 存在目录遍历漏洞 (CWE-22)。由于 servlet 未对用户提交的路径名参数进行充分验证和过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送包含目录遍历序列 (如 \"../\") 的精心构造路径名参数，突破 Web 应用根目录限制，读取服务器文件系统上的任意敏感文件 (如配置文件、密钥、日志等)。该漏洞影响 Cisco Prime DCNM 7.1(1) 之前的所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5 (HIGH)，攻击向量为网络 (AV:N)、攻击复杂度低 (AC:L)、无需权限 (PR:N)、无需用户交互 (UI:N)、不改变权限范围 (S:U)、机密性影响高 (C:H)、完整性和可用性无影响 (I:N/A:N)。攻击者只需网络可达目标 DCNM 服务器的 fmserver servlet 端点，即可发起攻击读取敏感文件。Cisco 已在 7.1(1) 版本中修复此漏洞 (Bug ID CSCus00241)，建议升级至修复版本。CISA 已将此漏洞列入已知被利用漏洞目录 (KEV)。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0666"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-04-03T10:59:04.290","updated":"2026-06-17T00:20:42.127","remediation":"立即升级Cisco Prime Data Center Network Manager到7.1(1)或更高版本，获取官方补丁修复目录遍历漏洞。同时关闭DCNM管理器的fmserver servlet服务或限制其访问权限作为紧急缓解措施，并加强系统安全配置，包括应用层路径验证和访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20150401-dcnm","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032009","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0666","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0666.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ff0be9f0ff9befb61502685e96c29ce6ed37e929/2015/0xxx/CVE-2015-0666.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0666","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-0666.rules","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-0666.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-0666.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-0666.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2015.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/798a31226c5b1d5c9cc61c5fe52f04996d380b21/data_single/2015/CVE-2015-0666.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0099.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0019","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2755","title":"WordPress AB Google Map Travel插件跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"WordPress AB Google Map Travel（AB-MAP）插件 4.0 版本之前存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意请求诱使已登录的管理员访问，从而劫持管理员会话，在未经授权的情况下通过 lat、long、map_width、map_height、zoom 等参数修改插件配置，进而触发跨站脚本攻击，导致恶意脚本注入及敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2755"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-04-01T14:59:07.803","updated":"2026-06-17T00:24:41.680","remediation":"立即将 WordPress AB Google Map Travel (AB-MAP) 插件升级到 4.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 后台用户管理中为管理员账户启用 Application Passwords 并禁用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截对 wp-admin/admin.php 中 ab_map_options 页面的外部来源 POST 请求，同时检查并移除插件中缺少 nonce 验证的表单处理函数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130960/WordPress-AB-Google-Map-Travel-CSRF-XSS.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131155/WordPress-Google-Map-Travel-3.4-XSS-CSRF.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/534954/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/535026/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/71417","https://wordpress.org/plugins/ab-google-map-travel/changelog/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2755.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2755.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2755.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2755.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2755","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2755_7.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-2755.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2755.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-2755_6.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b80121dc73e23dd13187ec16e91cd79074cff1b7/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-27xx/CVE-2015-2755.json","https://github.com/rxerium/CISA-KEV/blob/0fcfb8c0516a8ea2563628979ef2eb68236527b2/data/lists/NucleiList.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0018","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2196","title":"Web-Dorado Spider Event Calendar WordPress插件SQL注入漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 Spider Event Calendar 1.4.9 存在 SQL 注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 发送特制的 spiderbigcalendar_month 请求，在 cat_id 参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，从而获取数据库中的敏感信息（如用户凭证、密码哈希等）。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行该插件的所有 WordPress 站点。厂商至今未发布修复补丁，建议停用该插件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2196"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-03-03T19:59:02.467","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:44.737","remediation":"立即将 Spider Event Calendar 插件升级至最新版本 1.5.65（该版本已修复 SQL 注入漏洞）；由于该插件已于 2022 年 1 月永久关闭不再维护，建议彻底删除该插件并替换为其他仍在维护的 WordPress 日历插件。临时缓解措施：在 WAF 或 Web 服务器层面添加规则，对 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 请求中的 cat_id 参数过滤 SQL 注入关键字（如 UNION、SELECT、FROM 等），并限制 admin-ajax.php 的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36061","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36061","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2196.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2196.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2196.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2196.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2196","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/50629d052759f7d0d73f7da1b830ff6d52d10f93/nuclei-templates/2015/CVE-2015-2196-spider_event_calendar-f00b2602-b9ab-4f4a-a19e-5c2a98c232e3.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad583e79ed38e32f21eec5f8962c8f59146c10bc/CVE/data/2015/CVE-2015-2196.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-2196.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2015/CVE-2015-2196.json","https://github.com/aryan-mrrobot/My_astra/blob/23962709ab1d49d405b98453424e2c7152307781/THEX/custom_temp/command%20injection/CVE-2015-2196.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2196_6.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0015","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2068","title":"Magento Server MAGMI 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MAGMI（Magento Mass Importer）插件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `web/magmi.php` 的 `profile` 参数或 `web/magmi_import_run.php` 的 `QUERY_STRING` 注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML，在受害者浏览器会话中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，导致敏感信息泄露或会话劫持。攻击无需认证但需诱使用户访问特制链接，CVSS 4.3 中危。厂商至今未发布官方补丁，建议禁用该插件或限制访问权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2068"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-02-24T17:59:04.817","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:32.403","remediation":"升级 Magento 至 Magento 2 系列（Magento 1 已于 2020 年 6 月停止安全支持），并使用 Magento 2 原生导入功能替代 MAGMI 插件。如无法立即迁移，删除或重命名 magmi/web/ 目录下的 magmi.php 和 magmi_import_run.php 文件，或通过 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置访问控制，仅允许白名单 IP 访问 /magmi/ 路径，并对所有输入参数做 HTML 实体编码过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130250/Magento-Server-MAGMI-Cross-Site-Scripting-Local-File-Inclusion.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35996","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74879","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35996","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2068.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2068.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2068.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2068/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-2068.py","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2015-2068-2484.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2068.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/7001-to-8000-templates/cve-2015-2068-2486.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2015-2068_28.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2015-2068-2484.yaml","https://github.com/thompson005/nuclei-scanner/blob/6b5cfd844640c882a3d278f76f395a74ee14ef81/nucleivault/new%20templates/cve-2015-2068_1.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2015-2068.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0014","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2067","title":"MAGMI Magento Mass Importer 插件路径遍历漏洞","description":"MAGMI（Magento Mass Importer）插件 for Magento Server 的 `web/ajax_pluginconf.php` 文件存在路径遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含 `../` 的恶意 `file` 参数，利用目录穿越技术读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响使用该插件的 Magento 服务器，攻击复杂度低，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2067"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-02-24T17:59:03.817","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:32.290","remediation":"立即升级 MAGMI 插件至最新版本 0.7.21（SourceForge 下载），该版本修复了路径遍历问题。如无法升级，在 web/ajax_pluginconf.php 中对 file 参数进行严格过滤，禁止包含 `../` 等目录跳转字符，仅允许白名单内的合法文件名。若业务不需要 MAGMI 插件，建议直接禁用或删除该插件目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130250/Magento-Server-MAGMI-Cross-Site-Scripting-Local-File-Inclusion.html","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/35996","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74881","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2067.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-2067.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2067.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/CVE-2015-2067/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2015-2067.py","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2015-2067-2480.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2015-2067-2483.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2015-2067-2482.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-2067.yaml","https://github.com/amad3us47/amad3us47.github.io/blob/14d36cd646300e9b9b8fa1a2222524533239a69b/data/cve-2015-2067-2479.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/Z/z-11753.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder1/cve-2015-2067-2480.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0206","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-2051","title":"D-Link DIR-645 路由器 命令注入漏洞","description":"这是一个针对 D-Link DIR-645 有线/无线路由器操作系统命令注入漏洞。攻击者可以未认证地向目标路由器发送特制的 HNAP SOAP 请求，其中包含 GetDeviceSettings 操作，这种请求包含未经验证的字符串，这些字符串可以被服务器直接传递给系统的 shell 命令，导致操作系统命令注入攻击。攻击者可以利用这种漏洞在目标系统上执行任意命令（这是通过 GetDeviceSettings 操作完成的）。D-Link DIR-645 有线/无线路由器 Rev. Ax 上的固件版本 1.04b12 和更早的版本均受到影响。目标设备是一种家用网络设备，广泛应用于家庭和小型企业环境中。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分是 8.8（较高），这表明攻击者可以在不具备用户交互和权限的情况下远程触发该漏洞，这可能对系统的机密性、完整性和可用性造成严重影响。攻击者需要对目标设备的固件版本进行低级的的确认，可以向攻击者控制的目标系统发送畸形的 IPv6 数据包，这可以通过在网络上使用 TCP/IP 协议时实现。此外，攻击者还可以在未认证的情况下攻击，因为按照协议要求，攻击者可以删除或完全控制设备，或者在设备上预先指定 Web 大堂登录的基线版本的高版本。微软已在 2024 年 8 月份的 KB 安全更新中修复了此漏洞，但这可能需要另外的行动来更新用户的固件以确保他们的设备免受攻击。另外，该漏洞的已知攻击机制是可通过 POST 方法在 GET 地址上发送 SOAPAction 报头和完整的 SOAP XML HTTP 请求，从而触发服务器端代码执行攻击，这已经证实了这种可能是有可利用性的。相关的主要参考链接是：https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37171，该链接包括了来自 Exploit-D 的完整的代码示例。这是来自 Exploit 数据库的正确的与漏洞相关的攻击代码。通常情况下，这类攻击是可通过普通的 Web 浏览器来实现的。CVE-2015-2051 于 2015 年 2 月 23 日被披露与发布，目前已正式记入已知已利用的漏洞数据库 CISA。此漏洞还包括一些其他的相关的参考信息，可以作为一些进一步研究的方向，这些信息在 CISA 保密的相关的快照中提供了许多关于相关问题在此漏洞数据库中的相关扩展信息。因此，该漏洞目前仍在受到广泛关注中，许多网络安全专家对其保持着警惕，并将此漏洞作为广泛讨论和监管的焦点，尤其是对于广泛使用的企业家化网络设备上，这一漏洞的影响尤为严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-2051"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-02-23T17:59:08.320","updated":"2026-06-17T00:23:30.663","remediation":"立即将设备固件升级到 1.05b01 或更高版本，从 D-Link FTP 服务器下载补丁：ftp://ftp2.dlink.com/PRODUCTS/DIR-645/REVA/DIR-645_REVA_FIRMWARE_PATCH_1.05.B01.ZIP。在升级前请确认设备的硬件版本信息（Rev. Ax）。如设备已达产品生命周期终点，建议断开网络连接并更换新设备作为短期缓解措施","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://securityadvisories.dlink.com/security/publication.aspx?name=SAP10051","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72623","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/74870","https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10282","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37171/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-2051","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37171","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-2051.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-2051","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2015/CVE-2015-2051.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/dlink_cve-2015-2051.nasl","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4c8bc08999fabe8b3294f538c2b18b89d913b674/2015/2xxx/CVE-2015-2051.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-2051/README.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/sefcom/Witcher-experiment/blob/0fd0466f945c3ed0ef1f805c7dd44fcbf5b99303/firmware-targets/CVE-2015-2051/show.sh","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-2051.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0206.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0206.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0009","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1427","title":"Elasticsearch Elasticsearch Groovy 脚本引擎沙箱绕过远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Elasticsearch Groovy 脚本引擎沙盒存在安全绕过漏洞，攻击者可通过精心 crafted 的 Groovy 脚本打破沙盒保护机制，在目标系统中执行任意 shell 命令。该漏洞影响于允许用户运行脚本的 Elasticsearch 服务器，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可远程利用漏洞，以 Elasticsearch 服务进程的权限在受影响的服务器上执行任意代码，导致系统完全被接管。该漏洞的攻击条件极其苛刻，攻击者无需任何权限或用户交互即可实现，攻击复杂度低，对系统的保密性、完整性和可用性造成全面影响。漏洞 CVSS 评分高达 9.8，危害等级为严重，已公开发布并被多种安全研究平台收录利用代码。微软已针对此漏洞发布了多个安全补丁，用户需尽快升级至最新版本以修复此安全漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1427"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-02-17T15:59:04.560","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:24.453","remediation":"建议立即升级 Elasticsearch 到 1.3.8 或 1.4.3 或更高版本，以修复 Groovy 脚本引擎沙盒保护机制的安全绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时限制 Groovy 脚本权限或部署在防火墙后。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130368/Elasticsearch-1.3.7-1.4.2-Sandbox-Escape-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/130784/ElasticSearch-Unauthenticated-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.elasticsearch.com/blog/elasticsearch-1-4-3-1-3-8-released/","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/534689/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72585","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:0868","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/100850","https://www.elastic.co/community/security/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-1427","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36337","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1427.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-1427.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/elasticsearch/CVE-2015-1427/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-1427.json","https://github.com/orleven/Tentacle/blob/bc01b3d0d2f9a6117132f40e9098a16180335454/script/vul/elasticsearch/CVE-2015-1427.py","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/elasticsearch/poc_elasticsearch-cve-2015-1427_2015.py","https://github.com/bigblackhat/oFx/blob/9140ac44d93321048f2eabe402dcb9f25dae16e3/poc/Elasticsearch/Code_Exec_Groovy_CVE-2015-1427/poc.py","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog-pocs/blob/253291be2d307a6c836d5997bbb838f1e846f9ba/CVE/2015/CVE-2015-1427.yaml","https://github.com/CLincat/vulcat/blob/4ac98801f331920dd8c0840b8332164176edcab8/payloads/ElasticSearch/elasticsearch-cve-2015-1427-rce.py","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/elasticsearch/CVE-2015-1427.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/62d3575ad7f5edb0085d16f3737a19e0c0ea724b/2015/CVE-2015-1427/exploit.sh","https://github.com/t0kx/exploit-CVE-2015-1427","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2015-1427","https://github.com/h3inzzz/cve2015_1427","https://github.com/xpgdgit/CVE-2015-1427","https://github.com/Sebikea/CVE-2015-1427-for-trixie"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0011","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1579","title":"WordPress Elegant Themes Divi主题目录遍历漏洞","description":"WordPress Elegant Themes Divi主题存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 发送包含 `..` 路径遍历序列的 `img` 参数（action=revslider_show_image），实现任意文件读取，获取服务器敏感信息。该漏洞影响使用 Slider REvolution 插件 4.1.4 及之前版本的 WordPress 站点，攻击复杂度低，危害中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1579"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-02-11T19:59:06.417","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:38.490","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 Slider Revolution (RevSlider) 插件升级至 4.2 及以上版本，或更新 Elegant Themes Divi 主题至最新版。如无法升级，可删除或重命名插件目录中的 `revslider_show_image` 相关处理函数，或在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面拦截包含 `revslider_show_image` 及 `../` 的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36039","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/7540","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36554","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1579.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1579.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/3c5116308718006831f8b0ac674f891f3d553471/2015/CVE-2015-1579.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/http/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1579.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-1579","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2015-1579_3.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2015-1579-2023-09-21-1730_1","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2015/README.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2015-1579_1.yaml","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/706c16a4787d37bf8dcd30da5df424ea091c303e/2015/README.md","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/ccc7254104d3905a4851c058821c474f6497cc62/nvd/2015/CVE-2015-1579.json","https://github.com/paralelo14/WordPressMassExploiter","https://github.com/paralelo14/CVE-2015-1579"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0055","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0071","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer ASLR 安全机制绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 9 至 11 版本存在 ASLR（地址空间布局随机化）安全绕过漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造恶意网站，利用该漏洞获取内存基址信息，从而绕过系统的地址空间随机化保护机制。该漏洞需要用户通过浏览器访问攻击者控制的特制网页才能触发，用户交互要求较低。成功利用后可导致内存地址被泄露，攻击者可基于泄露的地址信息进一步构造ROP链或实现远程代码执行，危及用户系统完整性与安全性。Microsoft已于2015年2月的安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0071"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-02-11T03:01:12.497","updated":"2026-06-17T00:19:30.960","remediation":"应用 Microsoft 2015 年 2 月安全更新 MS15-009（KB3021952 及 KB3034196），优先通过 Windows Update 自动安装；若手动安装，须先安装 KB3021952 并重启系统，再通过 Windows Update 获取并安装 KB3034196，以修复 Internet Explorer 9/10/11 的 ASLR 安全绕过漏洞。受影响的版本包括运行 Windows Vista SP2、Windows 7 SP1、Windows 8、Windows 8.1、Windows Server 2008 SP2、Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1、Windows Server 2012、Windows Server 2012 R2 的系统上的 IE 9、IE 10 和 IE 11。如无法立即打补丁，可暂时更换为其他浏览器或限制 IE 访问外部网站，以降低遭遇 crafted 网页攻击的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72455","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031723","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2015/ms15-009","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0071","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0071.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2015/0xxx/CVE-2015-0071.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0071","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/742dc4cb264cf68c3a02b7d374414eaa8b12d853/2015/0xxx/CVE-2015-0071.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2015-0071.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-0071.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/798a31226c5b1d5c9cc61c5fe52f04996d380b21/data_single/2015/CVE-2015-0071.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2015/CVE-2015-0071.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p3rr-qc23-wf57/GHSA-p3rr-qc23-wf57.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0055.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0055.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0055.toml"}]